    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Wyse Residential is delighted to introduce to the open market this appealing two-bedroom, own-door apartment, ideally located in the popular New Row Square development in Dublin 8. The property is conveniently located within walking distance of Dublin City Centre, Temple Bar and of cafés, restaurants and shops. \r\n\r\nThe bright and space accommodation comprises of a welcoming entrance hall accessed via the apartment's own private front door, leading into the spacious living and dining room,  fully fitted kitchen, two spacious bedrooms and main bathroom. Additionally, communal car parking is available in the development's secure car park. \r\n\r\nThe property is ideally located with a short stroll of the heart of the host of amenities in Dublin City Centre. Popular tourist attractions such as St. Patrick's Cathedral and Park, Christchurch Cathedral, Dublin Castle are all close by, while the Guinness Storehouse, Teeling Whiskey Distillery and the many shops, bars, restaurants, cafés and cultural attractions of Dublin city Centre are also within easy walking distance.\r\n\r\nExcellent transport links are readily available, with numerous central bus routes operating from Patrick Street. Both Luas lines are within walking distance, while several Dublin Bike hubs are also conveniently located nearby."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway:\r\nWelcoming entrance hallway providing access to the main living space. \r\n\r\nLiving/Dining Room: 6.96m x 4.91m\r\nBright and spacious room with feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen: 2.88m x 1.55m\r\nFitted units incorporating fridge/freezer, washer/dryer, sink, oven, dishwasher and extractor fan.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.39m x 2.32m\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.43m x 2.48m\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.15m x 1.91m\r\nTiled bathroom comprising of a bath with shower fitting, whb and wc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-An appealing two bedroom, one bathroom ground floor apartment with its own front door located in the popular New Row Square development.\r\n-Conveniently located within a short stroll of amenities in the City Centre.\r\n-Communal car parking available in the development's secure car park.\r\n-Electric central heating.\r\n-Current annual service charge is €1470.86."
      },
      {
